## 1. Product vision

SaipratapS❤️C should allow anyone to create a professional website without needing programming knowledge.

Users should be able to:

- Generate websites using AI prompts.
- Create unlimited projects, subject to fair-use infrastructure controls.
- Edit websites using natural language.
- Customize layouts, colors, fonts, images, and components.
- Use a visual drag-and-drop editor.
- Access a code editor.
- Preview websites on desktop, tablet, and mobile.
- Automatically detect and fix website errors.
- Publish websites with free public URLs.
- Download complete website source code.
- Import existing websites and export projects.
- Install the platform as a PWA.

## 2. Problem statement

Many people want to create websites but face difficulties:

- Programming knowledge is required.
- Professional website development can be expensive.
- Hosting and deployment can be complicated.
- AI website tools may restrict publishing behind subscriptions.
- Website editing and troubleshooting can be difficult for beginners.

SaipratapS❤️C addresses these problems through an integrated AI website-generation, editing, testing, and publishing workflow.

